1
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,000
Mark only watched his reflection on the floor,

2
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,500
A cold grip holding me in silent strain.

3
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,000
But you don't count, you let the rhythm burn,

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,500
And look at me like sunlight in the rain.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,500
You break the rules inside this rigid hall,

6
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,000
No force or power, just a soul unleashed.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,500
You lead with warmth, expecting nothing back,

8
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:57,000
And open up the cage to free the beast.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,500
Midway through the jive you sang out loud,

10
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:13,000
A wild laugh without a trace of pride.

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,500
You give me wings to fly across the floor,

12
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:22,000
Our pounding chests colliding side by side.

13
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:29,000
We sweep the floor and clear the watching crowd,

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,500
Our heavy breathing lost inside the beat.

15
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:38,000
Safe in your arms I find my strength again,

16
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,500
Washed in the fire of your lion’s heat.

17
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,500
Yet in the height of our triumphant storm,

18
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:54,000
Laughing out loud at how the world looks on,

19
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,500
A sudden ice-cold shiver hits my spine,

20
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:03,000
And for a second all my breath is gone.

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,500
'Cause I must take you to my quiet world,

22
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:33,000
Far from the lights of this warm wooden floor.

23
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,500
Behind the closed white doors where silence waits,

24
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:42,000
Where music might just stop forevermore.

25
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:05,000
I hold on tight against your soaking shirt.

26
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,500
Beyond this room the shadows call my name.

27
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:14,000
But for tonight, you stay here in my arms.

28
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,500
We dance until the light of day remains.